{"seq":1,"slug":"mechatronics","title":"机电技术应用","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics","introMarkdown":"# 机电技术应用 简介\n\n机电技术应用（专业代码 660301）是中等职业教育中面向先进制造业的核心专业，培养掌握机械加工、电气控制与自动化技术的高素质技能人才。本专业对接电工、机修钳工、机床装调维修工、机电设备维修工等岗位群，兼顾就业上岗与对口升学两条发展路径。\n\n随着制造业向数字化、网络化、智能化方向深度转型，机电技术从业人员不仅需要传统的机械与电气操作能力，更需要掌握 PLC 编程、工业机器人操作、数字化产线维护等新型技能。2026 年\"1+X\"证书制度持续推进，工业机器人集成应用、可编程控制器系统应用编程、智能制造设备操作与维护等职业技能等级证书为学生提供了明确的能力认证路径。\n\n本专业课程体系分为四个核心模块：\n\n**第一章 机电基础** 构建机械制图识读、电工电路分析与电子技术三大基础能力，为后续专业技能学习奠定理论与实操根基。\n\n**第二章 PLC 与自动化** 聚焦可编程控制器编程、气液压传动控制及自动化生产线运行维护，这是当前机电岗位最普遍要求的核心技能。\n\n**第三章 设备维护与检修** 围绕电机维保、机床故障诊断与机电一体化系统检修展开实训，对接企业设备维修工岗位的实际需求。\n\n**第四章 智能制造实践** 引入工业机器人操作、数控加工编程与数字化制造趋势，帮助学生了解产业前沿并规划职业发展方向。\n\n建议学习路径：先夯实第一章基础知识，再进入第二章掌握自动化控制技术，第三章通过设备检修实训提升综合故障处理能力，最后在第四章接触智能制造新技术。学习过程中应坚持\"理实一体\"，将每个知识点与车间实操紧密结合。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mechanical-electrical-basics","title":"机电基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/mechanical-electrical-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mechanical-drawing-fundamentals","title":"机械制图基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/mechanical-electrical-basics/mechanical-drawing-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"electrical-circuits-components","title":"电工电路与元器件","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/mechanical-electrical-basics/electrical-circuits-components"},{"seq":3,"slug":"electronic-technology-basics","title":"电子技术基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/mechanical-electrical-basics/electronic-technology-basics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"plc-automation","title":"PLC与自动化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/plc-automation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"plc-programming-basics","title":"PLC编程基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/plc-automation/plc-programming-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pneumatic-hydraulic-systems","title":"气压与液压传动","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/plc-automation/pneumatic-hydraulic-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"automated-production-lines","title":"自动化生产线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/plc-automation/automated-production-lines"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"equipment-maintenance","title":"设备维护与检修","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/equipment-maintenance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"motor-transformer-maintenance","title":"电机与变压器维护","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/equipment-maintenance/motor-transformer-maintenance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"machine-tool-diagnosis","title":"机床故障诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/equipment-maintenance/machine-tool-diagnosis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mechatronic-system-repair","title":"机电一体化系统检修","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/equipment-maintenance/mechatronic-system-repair"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"smart-manufacturing-practice","title":"智能制造实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/smart-manufacturing-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-robot-basics","title":"工业机器人基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/smart-manufacturing-practice/industrial-robot-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cnc-machining-fundamentals","title":"数控加工基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/smart-manufacturing-practice/cnc-machining-fundamentals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-manufacturing-trends","title":"数字化制造趋势","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/smart-manufacturing-practice/digital-manufacturing-trends"}]}]}